017","ordinal":340779,"en":"He had taken the yellow rolling ridges,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l018","ordinal":340780,"en":"Defeated the khan’s people in battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l019","ordinal":340781,"en":"Broken through heights and opened roads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l020","ordinal":340782,"en":"Shaken the world and carried off plunder."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l021","ordinal":340783,"en":"He had surged forth and become a hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l022","ordinal":340784,"en":"The equal of any hero’s son."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l023","ordinal":340785,"en":"He wore a thick, bulletproof coat"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l024","ordinal":340786,"en":"And rode bullet-swift Buurul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l025","ordinal":340787,"en":"He had felled heroes, as the people knew,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l026","ordinal":340788,"en":"Worn his white coat of mail,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l027","ordinal":340789,"en":"Mounted his white-gray steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l028","ordinal":340790,"en":"And ruled the people before the nation’s eyes;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l029","ordinal":340791,"en":"Yet he had never seen an infidel like"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l030","ordinal":340792,"en":"Sarybay, the monstrous giant’s son."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l031","ordinal":340793,"en":"He loomed like Ala-Too,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l032","ordinal":340794,"en":"And towered like a craggy peak;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l033","ordinal":340795,"en":"Dust rose wherever he moved."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l034","ordinal":340796,"en":"When the immovable infidel stirred,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l035","ordinal":340797,"en":"His mere rumbling drove souls from bodies."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l036","ordinal":340798,"en":"No hero dared advance against him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l037","ordinal":340799,"en":"And none he faced remained alive."},{"